Package: lightson
Title: Download and Analyse Nighttime Lights Satellite Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary",
           email = "saketkc@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Unified interface for downloading and processing nighttime lights
    (NTL) satellite data from multiple sources: NASA VIIRS/Black Marble
    (VNP46A4 annual composites) and India's ISRO Bhuvan NTL portal. Provides
    bhuvan_stats() for instant pre-aggregated state-level radiance from the
    Bhuvan REST API, bhuvan_raster() for WMS GeoTIFF tiles compatible with
    any custom sf geometry, extract_panel() for tidy long-format zonal
    statistics ready for econometric panel regression, and convenience
    functions for Indian administrative boundaries.
